<title>USA: Ziegler sets special payout of $0.30/share.</title>
<headline>Ziegler sets special payout of $0.30/share.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BEND, Wis. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ziegler Cos Inc said its board declared a special dividend of $0.30 per share, in addition to a regular quarterly dividend of $0.13 per share.</p>
<p>The regular dividend was unchanged from the previous quarter. Both dividends are payable January 17 to shareholders of record on January 6, said the financial services company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
